# Public site URL — used for SEO canonical/OG tags, sitemap, robots and
# JSON-LD. Must be the www host: apex qasem-portal.com 308-redirects to www at
# the platform level (same pattern as cue-app.net), and every canonical URL
# derives from this value.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.qasem-portal.com

# Cloudflare Turnstile — bot protection on the contact and careers forms.
# Site key is public (rendered in the widget); secret key is server-only.
# If the secret is unset in production the submit API fails closed (503);
# in dev it falls back to Cloudflare's always-pass test keys.
# IMPORTANT: the widget's hostname allowlist in the Cloudflare dashboard must
# cover BOTH qasem-portal.com/www AND *.vercel.app preview URLs from day one —
# Cue's widget only allowlisted production and silently failed on previews.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=

# Server-only Firebase Admin SDK credential: the service-account key JSON,
# base64 encoded (raw JSON also accepted). Never expose with a NEXT_PUBLIC_
# prefix; store the source key in an encrypted vault, not the repo.
# REQUIRED in production for /api/contact: it persists submissions AND holds
# the IP rate-limit counters. Without it (and without FIRESTORE_EMULATOR_HOST)
# the route fails closed with 503 rather than accepting unmetered submissions.
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON=

# REQUIRED IN PRODUCTION. Salt for the hashed IP rate-limit keys. There is
# deliberately NO default — an unset value 503s in production rather than
# hashing IPs with a guessable salt. Generate a fresh random value:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
# Changing it resets open rate-limit windows.
# IP_HASH_SALT=

# Resend — transactional notification email on each form submission.
# The from address must be on the verified qasem-portal.com domain.
# Optional: if RESEND_API_KEY is unset the submission is still stored in
# Firestore (storage is the source of truth; email is a courtesy copy).
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# CONTACT_INBOX=adam@qasem-portal.com
# MAIL_FROM=Qasem Portal <notifications@qasem-portal.com>

# When entering any of these in the Vercel dashboard, paste through a plain
# text editor first and re-check for BOM corruption — Cue lost partner leads
# to an invisible leading BOM character in its Firebase env vars.
